          "text": "Description: A motorist reports by phone seeing a dark \"plate\" flying object performing a turn and disappearing towards Lille, near Compiègne. No noise was heard by the witness. Despite follow-ups, no additional information on the precise location, position, duration... or complements on the characteristics arrived at GEIPAN. The case is classified C due to lack of information.",
